@base = http://localhost:4000/api

### liste avec pagination
GET {{base}}/products?limit=5&skip=0

### recherche et filtre
GET {{base}}/products?q=phone&category=smartphones

### un produit
GET {{base}}/products/1

### creer
POST {{base}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "My product",
  "description": "Created from the lab",
  "price": 19.99,
  "thumbnail": "https://cdn.dummyjson.com/product-images/1/thumbnail.webp",
  "stock": 10,
  "category": "lab"
}

### corps invalide -> 400
POST {{base}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "x", "price": -5 }

### modifier
PATCH {{base}}/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "price": 9.5 }

### supprimer (mets l'id du produit cree)
DELETE {{base}}/products/101

### inexistant -> 404
GET {{base}}/products/99999
